          </lowerValue>
          <upperValue xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.cdifDataType.cdifProvActivity.ProvActivity.schema_object.upper" xmi:uuid="4ff1a623-ba31-5e55-8158-87e670906dc5">
            <value>1</value>
          </upperValue>
          <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.cdifDataType.cdifProvActivity.ProvActivity.schema_object.comment" xmi:uuid="921122d6-c01a-5ddf-860f-62fe2874d5a3">
            <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

Input entity (or entities) for this activity. Per schema.org, the range of schema:object is schema:Thing. Accepts four shapes (1) a string URI, (2) an @id reference object, (3) an inline schema:Thing object, or (4) an array whose items take any of those shapes (used when an activity has multiple inputs, e.g. samples analyzed). Supports action chaining where the value references the result of a prior activity.
:jsonName: "schema:object"</body>
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdif.bbr.metadata.cdifDataType.cdifProvActivity.ProvActivity.schema_object"/>
          </ownedComment>
        </ownedAttribute>
        <ownedAttribute xmi:type="uml:Property" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.cdifDataType.cdifProvActivity.ProvActivity.schema_result" xmi:uuid="802cd828-a675-5e75-9682-80afa05987c4">
          <name>schema_result</name>
          <type xmi:idref="cdif.bbr.metadata.cdifDataType.cdifProvActivity.ProvActivityObjectChoice"/>
          <lowerValue xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.cdifDataType.cdifProvActivity.ProvActivity.schema_result.lower" xmi:uuid="b84ca438-5734-5101-bcb0-22f7ae7c2fdf">
            <value>0</value>
          </lowerValue>
          <upperValue xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.cdifDataType.cdifProvActivity.ProvActivity.schema_result.upper" xmi:uuid="114ddbee-2ffb-5ae7-94b5-86365c0bf220">
            <value>1</value>
          </upperValue>
          <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.cdifDataType.cdifProvActivity.ProvActivity.schema_result.comment" xmi:uuid="a5efee6e-5469-5e2a-a4ff-be16bb56137b">
            <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

Output entity (or entities) produced by this activity. Per schema.org, the range is schema:Thing. Accepts: (1) a string URI reference (action chaining shorthand to be referenced as schema:object of a subsequent activity); (2) a single {"@id": "&lt;uri&gt;"} object reference; (3) an inline schema:Thing (object with @type); or (4) an array of any of these forms (e.g. multiple datasets produced by this activity). Profiles may restrict the array item shape further.
:alternativeOverrides: {"idReference": {"idRefDescription": "reference to an output entity"}, "object": {"description": "Inline schema:Thing object describing the output entity."}, "choiceList": {"description": "Multiple output entities. Each item may be a string URI, an @id reference, or an inline schema:Thing."}}
:jsonName: "schema:result"</body>
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdif.bbr.metadata.cdifDataType.cdifProvActivity.ProvActivity.schema_result"/>
          </ownedComment>
        </ownedAttribute>
